{
    "Conv_Div":
    {
        "Introductions":
        [
            "============================================================================",
            "DESCRIPTION: Fuse Div Scalar Into Conv Operation",
            "============================================================================",
            "This transformation pattern searches for a Conv operation followed by a Div",
            "operation where the Div node divides the Conv output by a scalar value.",
            "When found, this pattern fuses these two operations by:",

            "1. Dividing the Conv node's weight initializer by the scalar value",
            "2. Dividing the Conv node's bias initializer by the scalar value if present",
            "3. Removing the subsequent Div node",
            "4. Directing the Conv output directly to the Div node's output",

            "This optimization reduces model complexity and improves inference performance",
            "by reducing the number of operations and memory allocations.",

            "PRECONDITIONS:",
            "- Div node must consume the Conv output as its first input",
            "- Div node must have its second input as an initializer (constant)",
            "- Div node's second input must be a scalar value",
            "- Conv node must directly feed into the Div node",

            "RESULT: Single Conv operation with fused weight/bias instead of Conv + Div",
            "Example:",
            "- BEFORE (SearchBy):",
            "   input → Conv[weights, bias] → Div[scalar] → output",
            "- AFTER (ReplaceBy):",
            "   input → Conv[weights/scalar, bias/scalar] → output",
            "============================================================================"
        ],
        "SearchBy":
        {
            "nodes": [
                {
                    "op_type": "Conv"
                },
                {
                    "var": "div_node",
                    "op_type": "Div",
                    "inputs": [
                        "{div_node.input[0]} == {node.output[0]}",
                        "(IsInitializer({div_node.input[1]}) == True) and (IsScalar({div_node.input[1]}) == True)"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "ReplaceBy":
        {
            "graph": {
                "initializers": [
                    {
                        "name": "W_scaled",
                        "data": "numpy.divide({node.input[1]}, {div_node.input[1]})",
                        "data_type": "GetDataType({node.output[0]})"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "{node.input[1]}",
                        "Action": "Remove"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "B_scaled",
                        "data": "numpy.divide({node.input[2]}, {div_node.input[1]}) or numpy.divide([0], {div_node.input[1]})",
                        "data_type": "GetDataType({node.output[0]})"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "{node.input[2]}",
                        "Action": "Remove"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "CheckInitializer({div_node.input[1]})",
                        "Action": "Remove"
                    }
                ],
                "nodes": [
                    {
                        "name": "{node.name}",
                        "Action": "Modify",
                        "inputs": [
                            "{node.input[0]}",
                            "W_scaled",
                            "B_scaled"
                        ],
                        "outputs": [
                            "{div_node.output[0]}"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "{div_node.name}",
                        "Action": "Remove"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    }
}
